  "_ignoredComment": "Boards deliberately NOT polled, with the reason recorded. Checked by both `npm run discover` and `discover --add`, so a decision made once is not quietly undone by a later probe. Matched on ats+slug, case-insensitively. This is the right home for any \"we looked at it and said no\" verdict about a board.",
  "ignored": [
    {
      "ats": "smartrecruiters",
      "slug": "Bertelsmann-Jobs",
      "name": "Bertelsmann (group board)",
      "reason": "Same catalogue as the careersites source, which names the real employer. This board reports company \"Bertelsmann-Jobs\" on all 1,005 postings, so every job would appear twice under two different employers — and a constant company makes sha1(company|title|city) collide: 17 title+city pairs are shared, which would silently swallow 18 postings. careersites reads the same jobs from the group sitemap and gives smartclip / Riverty / Arvato Systems.",
      "decidedAt": "2026-09-09"
    }
  ],
