  "_workdayComment": "Hand-entered, never probed: *.myworkdayjobs.com is a wildcard that answers 422 for invented tenants, so guessing would fabricate companies. To add one: open the company career site, click any job, copy the URL, and run npm run discover -- --workday <url> to verify and append it.",
  "_getroComment": "VC portfolio boards. One board covers every company a fund has invested in, so this reaches small employers nothing else here would list. `collection` is the board's network id, found in the page's __NEXT_DATA__ as a STRING (\"network\":{\"id\":\"617\"}); leave it out and it is resolved on the first fetch at the cost of one page request. Measured 2026-09-29 across these six: 9,397 postings total, 929 remote, 109 unique hits on six infrastructure terms, 18 passing a real title gate, 12 not US/APAC-anchored - for 42 requests.",
